<title>USA: Eveleth-Gilbert ISD 2154, Minn., won by Dain.</title>
<headline>Eveleth-Gilbert ISD 2154, Minn., won by Dain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth, Inc said it won $1.490 million of Eveleth-Gilbert Public Schools Independent School District 2154, Minn., general obligation capital facilities bonds, Series 1996B, with a true interest cost of 5.6717 percent.  </p>
<p>AMT: 1,490,000	DATE: 09/10/96	NYC Time: 1200	CUSIP: 299711</p>
